<p class="h2" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #0071c5; line-height: 19px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span class="eloquaemail"></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">{!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Welcome to Intel&reg; Partner Alliance Artificial Intelligence Data Centre Speciality! As a qualified Artificial Intelligence Data Centre Specialist, you are eligible for speciality benefits* that are designed to help deliver and implement your solutions, including:<br>
</p><ul style="font-size: 11px;">
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Artificial Intelligence Data Centre Specialist designation</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Intel promotion of your company as an Artificial Intelligence Specialist</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Additional points when purchasing Intel&reg; Server Portfolio<sup style="vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; top: -0.4em;">1</sup> Products</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Access to Intel Artificial Intelligence Resources</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Priority invitations to industry events and training sessions</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">Access to Intel Platform Testing Services</li>
</ul>
<p>To get started, please reply to <a href="ITP-AI@intel.com">ITP-AI@intel.com</a> with the following information:</p>
<p><li style="font-size: 11px;">Primary contact for Artificial Intelligence Specialist communications</li>
<div>Name:<div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 10px">Email:</div>
</P>
<p><li style="font-size: 11px;">For additional sales and promotion materials</li>
<div>Physical Postal Address:</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 10px">Phone:<div>
</p>
<P><table style="padding: 0px; width: auto; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<td style="background: #00aeef; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; border-radius: 3px; border: currentColor; text-align: center !important; color: #fefefe; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-word-wrap: break-word; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><a style="margin: 0px; padding: 5px 0px; border-radius: 3px; border: 0px solid #00aeef; text-align: left; color: #fefefe; line-height: 1.3; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;" href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/uk/en/secure/partner-alliance/membership/specialties/artificial-intelligence/overview.html">Access benefits</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></P>
<P>*Benefits may vary by geography.</P>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Intel partners have a long history of innovation, and with Intel&reg; Partner Alliance, we&rsquo;ll help you accelerate building solutions for the data-centric economy. Together, we can connect, innovate, and grow, making extraordinary opportunities possible.</P>
<P>Visit <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/uk/en/partner-alliance/help/overview.html">intel.com/partnerhelp</a> for help and guidance on optimising your membership.</P>
<br>Thank you,<br>Your Intel&reg; Partner Alliance team</p>
<P><sup style="vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; top: -0.4em;">1</sup> Data Centre Portfolio products: Intel&reg; Xeon&reg; Processors; Intel&reg; Network Infrastructure Solutions; Server Boards &amp; Barebones Systems; Intel&reg; SSD Data Centre Family; Wind River OS, Intel&reg; FPGA Product Family; API Management; Intel&reg; HPC Software; Intel&reg; HPC Orchestrator; Intel&reg; Omni-Path Architecture; Intel&reg; Solutions for Lustre Software.</P>
